  "claim": "The American web televison series, which is set in the MCU, stars an actress who is also known as \"scream girl\" for having rolls in horror films such as \"Prom Night\" and \"Vampire Bats\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Jessica Stroup. Sentence: Jessica Leigh Stroup (born October 23, 1986) is an American actress, best known for her role as Erin Silver on \"90210\", Max Hardy on \"The Following\", and Joy Meachum in \"Iron Fist\".\nPage: Jessica Stroup. Sentence: She is regarded as a scream queen for starring in the horror films \"Prom Night\", \"Vampire Bats\", \"Left in Darkness\", and \"The Hills Have Eyes 2\".\nPage: Iron Fist (TV series). Sentence: Marvel's Iron Fist, or simply Iron Fist, is an American web television series created for Netflix by Scott Buck, based on the Marvel Comics character of the same name.\nPage: Iron Fist (TV series). Sentence: It is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), sharing continuity with the films of the franchise and is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to \"The Defenders\" crossover miniseries.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Jessica Stroup. Sentence: Jessica Leigh Stroup (born October 23, 1986) is an American actress, best known for her role as Erin Silver on \"90210\", Max Hardy on \"The Following\", and Joy Meachum in \"Iron Fist\".\nPage: Jessica Stroup. Sentence: She is regarded as a scream queen for starring in the horror films \"Prom Night\", \"Vampire Bats\", \"Left in Darkness\", and \"The Hills Have Eyes 2\".\nPage: Iron Fist (TV series). Sentence: Marvel's Iron Fist, or simply Iron Fist, is an American web television series created for Netflix by Scott Buck, based on the Marvel Comics character of the same name.\nPage: Iron Fist (TV series). Sentence: It is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), sharing continuity with the films of the franchise and is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to \"The Defenders\" crossover miniseries.",
