        "original_id": "8b66f780-87bf-5156-bc2e-39e271fce565",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jessica Stroup, Scott Buck\n- TV series: Iron Fist, 90210, The Following, The Defenders\n- Films: Prom Night, Vampire Bats, Left in Darkness, The Hills Have Eyes 2\n- Characters/Roles: Erin Silver, Max Hardy, Joy Meachum\n- Organizations/Franchises: Netflix, Marvel Comics, Marvel Cinematic Universe\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Leigh Stroup was born on October 23, 1986, and she is an American actress.\n- Jessica Stroup is best known for playing Erin Silver on 90210, Max Hardy on The Following, and Joy Meachum in Iron Fist.\n- Jessica Stroup is regarded as a scream queen for starring in the horror films Prom Night, Vampire Bats, Left in Darkness, and The Hills Have Eyes 2.\n- Iron Fist is an American web television series created for Netflix by Scott Buck and based on the Marvel Comics character of the same name.\n- Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the films of that franchise.\n- Iron Fist is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
